{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913270/extras/850d1b00f11052d6f774ae1c733b9723.avif?t=1763430549\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913270/extras_big/850d1b00f11052d6f774ae1c733b9723.avif?t=1763430549 width=1560 height=326 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster 'Slime' that fell in front of the house one day, could you turn this crisis into an opportunity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913270/extras/9973d5de709c41fb1abdea4f5671ad51.avif?t=1763430549\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slime can't easily get rid of it, the more you try to get rid of it, the myriad little slimes that pop out just despair you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913270/extras/be0dd9162198799585040c9d650d3ca8.avif?t=1763430549\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You should use these little slimes as your resources to strengthen your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913270/extras/c8a8c6354d855ff668a9d37b7c65181e.avif?t=1763430549\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913270/extras_big/c8a8c6354d855ff668a9d37b7c65181e.avif?t=1763430549 width=1560 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources to build various buildings and gather courageous mercenaries! Only when your town becomes powerful can you defeat this heinous monster.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3913270?